      "content": "<div style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 16px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7ff, #eefaf6); border: 1px solid #dbe7ff; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(120,140,200,.12); font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; line-height: 1.7; color: #334;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:10px;\">\n    <img src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/疑惑\" width=\"88\" style=\"border-radius: 8px;\">\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color:#4b5bdc;\">唔，天气一般般呀~</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color:#667;\">那就是一种“不会太糟，但也不够惊艳”的微妙心情呢，主人~</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff; border-radius:12px; padding:12px 14px; border:1px dashed #cfd8ff; margin-bottom:10px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-weight:700; color:#5562cc;\">粽子的小判断：</span><br>\n    这种天气最适合——\n    <span style=\"background:#eef2ff; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:999px; margin:0 4px;\">慢悠悠</span>\n    <span style=\"background:#eafaf1; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:999px; margin:0 4px;\">喝点热的</span>\n    <span style=\"background:#fff1f3; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:999px; margin:0 4px;\">做点轻松的事</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap:10px; margin:12px 0;\">\n    <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:10px; border:1px solid #eee; text-align:center;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;\">☕</div>\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;\">饮品模式</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#777;\">奶茶 / 咖啡 / 热可可</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:10px; border:1px solid #eee; text-align:center;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;\">🎧</div>\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;\">发呆模式</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#777;\">听歌最配这种天</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:10px; b